  "entries": [
    {
      "ordinal": 0,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_01",
      "hash64": "04DCA3FBE2124FD0",
      "text": "我很危险……！\\n你最好不要靠近我……！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_02",
      "hash64": "04DCA6FBE21254E9",
      "text": "不要理我……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_03",
      "hash64": "04DCA5FBE2125336",
      "text": "…………",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_04",
      "hash64": "04DCA8FBE212584F",
      "text": "莫非，你也……\\n和我……一样吗……？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_05",
      "hash64": "04DCA7FBE212569C",
      "text": "你果然也……\\n听到了“声音”，是这样吗……？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_06",
      "hash64": "04DCAAFBE2125BB5",
      "text": "是这样啊……\\n是什么指引了你……？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_select_01",
      "hash64": "2C3001979E4B352C",
      "text": "是光明……？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_select_02",
      "hash64": "2C3004979E4B3A45",
      "text": "是风……？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_select_03",
      "hash64": "2C3003979E4B3892",
      "text": "是黑暗……？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_select_04",
      "hash64": "2C2FFE979E4B3013",
      "text": "不自觉地就来了",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_select_05",
      "hash64": "2C2FFD979E4B2E60",
      "text": "我不知道",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_07",
      "hash64": "04DCA9FBE2125A02",
      "text": "是光明啊……嗯……\\n和光明有些不一样……！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_08",
      "hash64": "04DCACFBE2125F1B",
      "text": "咦？是风！？\\n还可以那样啊……！\\r\\n原来如此……很悦耳……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 16,
          "count": 1,
          "code_hex": "BE00",
          "args_hex": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_09",
      "hash64": "04DCABFBE2125D68",
      "text": "黑暗……黑暗果然很美妙……\\n漆黑的心都要干枯了……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_10",
      "hash64": "04D93EFBE20F6E5A",
      "text": "不自觉……那可不好……\\n你要更认真地思考才行……！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_11",
      "hash64": "04D93FFBE20F700D",
      "text": "你也会……隐隐作痛吧？\\n你那只手……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_select_06",
      "hash64": "2C3000979E4B3379",
      "text": "右手？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_select_07",
      "hash64": "2C2FFF979E4B31C6",
      "text": "左手？",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_12",
      "hash64": "04D93CFBE20F6AF4",
      "text": "右手……？抱歉……\\n看来是我猜错了啊……",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_13",
      "hash64": "04D93DFBE20F6CA7",
      "text": "没错！没错啊，就是左手……！\\n你果然厉害……我的同志……！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 20,
      "label": "s2_sub_038_man_14",
      "hash64": "04D93AFBE20F678E",
      "text": "我视你为同志，\\n授予你黄昏之印。",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "DECODED",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": []
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 21,
      "label": "s2_sub_011_system_01",
      "hash64": "340BF1E47E73D21E",
      "text": "[VAR 0x0100(0000)]从男孩那里\\n获授了[VAR 0xFF00(0008)]左手隐隐作痛动作[VAR 0xFF00(0000)]！",
      "flags": 0,
      "text_status": "CONTROL_PARTIAL",
      "label_encoding_status": "UTF8",
      "label_raw_hex": null,
      "tokens": [
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 0,
          "count": 2,
          "code_hex": "0100",
          "args_hex": [
            "0000"
          ]
        },
        {
          "kind": "control",
          "offset_units": 13,
